    <string name="about">About Cassini</string>
    <string name="about_body">Cassini turns speech into searchable, timed text on your phone. Audio stays local.\n\nRecord voice notes, search past transcriptions, and save portable Cassini Opus documents with audio and timed words.\n\nSpeakers are labelled and recognised on the phone (voices never leave it), with automatic multilingual recognition. The current transcript language label is Italian.\n\nGPLv3. Source and dependency notices: github.com/codemyriad/cassini-android</string>
